{"id":"vod_bf_40868","vodId":"40868","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"学园救援团","name_cn":"学园救援团","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/21789b513790312b55fe3e3d65ec005e.jpg"},"summary":"奔走面对困难时，还会伴随着诸多无厘头要素，比如说解密、动作、冷笑话等等等等，是一部让人看了非常轻松愉快的可爱作品。　　作为一部在JUMP上已经连载了15卷的长篇人气作品，该作的同名小说已发售2本，连同名DRAMA CD都出了2张，并且是拥有吉野裕行、白石凉子、杉田智和、小西克幸等等人气声优助阵的超豪华阵容——这样一部强势作品，在国内却并不非常出名。相反，没有庞大的世界观，没有帅气的必杀技，只有吐槽、欢笑、各种恶搞的这部轻松可爱的作品在海外却受到了极大注目。在此希望本次的TV动画化企划，能够带起国内对这部作品的关注，让更多的人接受这部非常有趣的作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:59:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":77,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xueyuanjiuyuantuan/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rr